# Guide Orchestrator

Multi-domain brand agent workspace. On brand/IP/marketing/XHS/visual tasks:

1. Read `AGENTS.md` → `rules/WORKSPACE.md` → `rules/skills/INDEX.md`
2. Load `.cursor/skills/guide-core/SKILL.md` and route per `routing.md`
3. Google Docs/Gmail/Calendar → `rules/skills/skill_google_docs.md` (+ local overlay)
4. Generative templates → `kernels/templates/`
5. Local drafts → `content/<domain>/`

Do not invent Drive folder IDs; use overlay or search when MCP is authorized.
